{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Shanhai Fu Mo Lu","A civilization that disappeared in the dust, the ancient bosses sought their own way to become emperors. Jiang Hao, a modern young man who was originally a chess piece, stepped into the prehistoric wilderness in order to find the whereabouts of his father. With his incomplete \"power bank\" totem, he fought with people, from primitive tribes to the mysterious ancient city, he fought his way out; he fought with the earth, crossed the wilderness, hunted ancient beasts, and learned the ancient and mysterious totem witchcraft from the beasts; he fought with the sky, and the magic light from the sky suddenly appeared, wanting to devour this magnificent six wastelands. He went upstream, ignited himself, turned into the sun, and fought with the devil! He was shaking the world, but he didn't know that the shackles of fate had already trapped him, and his father's smile was still lingering."],"ja":["山海伏魔录",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-60248","ids":{"shikimori":60248,"mal":60248,"anilist":185830,"kodik":"serial-63636"},"kodikIds":["serial-63293","serial-63636"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-63293":"2025-01-08T10:22:59Z","serial-63636":"2024-12-25T14:37:03Z"},"title":"Сказания об уничтожении демонов","originalTitle":"Shanhai Fu Mo Lu","alt":"Adventures in Subduing the Demons / Wu Huang / The Wizard Lord / Shanhai Fumolu / Shan Hai Fu Mo Lu 山海伏魔录","description":"Цивилизация, которая исчезла в прахе, древние правители искали свой собственный путь, чтобы стать императорами. Цзян Хао Цзян, современный молодой человек, который изначально был шахматной фигурой, отправился в доисторическую пустыню, чтобы найти местонахождение своего отца. Со своим неполным тотемом \"банка силы\" он сражался с людьми, от примитивных племен до таинственного древнего города, он пробивал себе путь наружу; он сражался с землей, пересек пустыню, охотился на древних зверей и научился древнему и таинственному тотемному колдовству у зверей; он сражался с небом., и внезапно появился волшебный свет с неба, желая поглотить эти великолепные шесть пустошей. Он пошел вверх по течению, воспламенился, превратился в солнце и сразился с дьяволом! Он сотрясал мир, но он не знал, что оковы судьбы уже поймали его в ловушку, и улыбка его отца все еще сияла.","year":2024,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Фэнтези","исторический","боевые искусства"],"rating":6.55,"popularity":131,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/60248/835687d2084322b8873807d67b6bdd35.jpeg","width":745,"height":995},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/8f90562414108974346d6864bd1e2b95a417c4de.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-63293","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1382136/1ff55bb1af21ccedf053e44eb8285516/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-3209","dubId":"3209","label":"HORIZON","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-63636","translationId":"3209","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1390563/d686a9661c912a713ad60abcaad66be2/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-63293","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1383973/714d